@startuml
title Smart Shopping - C4 Level 1: System Context
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #B52330
  BackgroundColor #FFF4F4
  FontColor #202025
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #EEEEEE
  BorderColor #202025
}
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor #FAF5F5
skinparam LegendBorderColor #B52330
left to right direction

actor "Shopper\n(compares laptop prices)" as Shopper
actor "System Operator\n(runs and tunes the system)" as Operator

rectangle "Smart Shopping\n[software system]\nPrice evidence, stored forecasts, advice,\nAI explanation, energy-adaptive operation" as SYS

rectangle "Price Data Provider\n[external]\napproved CSV or API" as SRC #FFFFFF
rectangle "Energy Signal Provider\n[external]\nsimulated, optionally Electricity Maps" as ESP #FFFFFF
rectangle "LLM Provider\n[external]\nlarge model, European provider preferred" as LLM #FFFFFF
rectangle "Kubernetes platform\n[external]\nscheduling, node pools" as K8S #FFFFFF

Shopper --> SYS : searches, reads evidence,\nasks questions
Operator --> SYS : edits policy, reviews\nflagged answers, watches dashboards
SRC --> SYS : price observations (pull)
ESP --> SYS : carbon intensity, price,\nrenewable flag (pull)
SYS --> LLM : evidence payload,\nlarge-model calls
SYS --> K8S : taints, workload placement

legend bottom
  C4 context view: the system as one box with its users and the external systems it depends on.
  Containers are shown in c4-container.puml; components in component-model.puml.
endlegend
@enduml
